		{
			id: "30B43B34367293CB"
			title: "Take Three Eggs to Marnie"
			subtitle: "Pip is watching the box."
			icon: "minecraft:egg"
			description: ["Pip: \"Is that an egg? Aunt Marnie says I get a duck if I'm useful, so I am being extremely useful.\"", "", "Collect &a3 eggs&r from the nesting box behind your house and hand them in. Right-click a hen with &achicken feed&r if you would rather not wait for her.", "", "Pip puts a duckling on your boot and names it Biscuit. Ducks, cows and pets have a chapter of their own: &6Animals and Fishing&r."]
