			description: ["Bram: \"I don't need help — I need somebody to hold things. Different word, same pair of hands.\"", "", "Walk to the mill plot marked on your map, talk to &bBram&r, and bring back the Millwright's Bolt he puts in your hand.", "", "He opens his labelled crates: &a12 iron ingots&r and &a24 andesite&r. More than the eight alloys want, because the Millstone takes the rest."]
