			icon: "create:andesite_alloy"
			description: ["Bram: \"Two andesite, two nuggets, corner to corner. Eight of them, not nine — if you're making nine you've misread something.\"", "", "Craft &a8 Andesite Alloy&r. Each one is two andesite and two iron nuggets in a 2x2 checker: sixteen andesite, and two ingots' worth of nuggets. Hold all eight when you hand in.", "", "Shafts, cogs, belts and everything else that turns live in the &6Create&r chapter."]
