			subtitle: "Ten seconds a plank, and they're boards."
			icon: "valley:seasoned_oak_board"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Green planks want heat and time. Josie dried every board in this valley in a furnace and was insufferable about it.\"", "", "Smelt the 32 &aGreen Oak Planks&r in any furnace — ten seconds a plank — and hold 32 &aSeasoned Oak Boards&r. Marnie's charcoal is in the barrel by the door.", "", "Bram cannot build a Water Wheel until these dry, and the furnace is you. The kitchen kit comes with them: see &6Cooking and Brewing&r."]
